      "writtenOn": "2025-02-06T16:39:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems to be `defer_rollback_protection`, could we DRY it?\n\nAlso, do we really need to `extract_sk_public_key_from_host_ref_dt()` when  `!defer_rollback_protection`, given that updatability is not enabled (flag), not supported, and/or not requested so why would the key be necessary?\n\nFor example, would it make sense to (in `create_vm_internal()`):\n```\nlet defer_rollback_protection \u003d cfg!(llpvm_changes)\n    \u0026\u0026 extract_want_updatable(config)\n    \u0026\u0026 is_secretkeeper_supported();\nlet secretkeeper_public_key \u003d if !defer_rollback_protection {\n    None\n} else if let Some(k) \u003d get_secretkeeper_public_key_from_hal()? {\n    Some(k)\n} else if let Some(k) \u003d get_secretkeeper_public_key_from_host_dt()? {\n    Some(k)\n} else {\n    return Err(...);\n};\n// Note: there might be a better way to write this than these if/else-if/else?\n```\n?",
